  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里究竟是什么地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”终成眷属……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 03 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}可恶……地板竟然塌了……\n到底是怎么设计的……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}而且掉得相当深啊。\n这里只有我们两个……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}什……无、无礼之徒！\n还不放手！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:3:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}……喂、喂！\n松不开啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}看来，你们已经抵达了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}谁、谁在那里！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}前方究竟有什么在等待呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}你们可以手牵着手，\n怀着好奇与恐惧迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}你说什么……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我说，你们可以迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}来，迈出脚步吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞机械语音消失了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}等、等等！那也就是说，\n是你把我们的手……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010a",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 31 01 0A 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010a",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}开玩笑吧……\n难道要一直保持这样……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 0E 01 02 01 01 01}冷静点{F5 47 02 01 31 01 01 01 05 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}总会有办法的{F5 47 02 01 31 01 01 01 05 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我倒是很欢迎{F5 47 02 01 31 01 01 01 05 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}也、也是……抱歉。\n事发突然，我有些失态了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0122",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}呵呵……你真可靠。\n看来队长不是白当的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0123",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}我现在也是你的搭档。\n紧要关头，你也尽管依靠我。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}什么总会有办法……\n哪有工夫这么悠哉！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0132",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}要是一直松不开，\n你也会……那个，该怎么说……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:17:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0132",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 31 01 04 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}……。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:17:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0132",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 04 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}不，抱歉……你说得对。\n光着急也解决不了问题。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 05 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}什……\n笨蛋，别在这种时候开玩笑！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:18:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}那是敌人为了扰乱我们设下的陷阱。\n不要当真！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014a",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 31 01 06 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}……。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:19:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014a",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 05 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}所以说，别傻笑了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}还有……刚才对不起。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}那个……没搞清楚状况，\n就把你当成无礼之徒了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:20:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}这手……那个……\n在意也没用。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_305.bf.json:20:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 31 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}总、总而言之！\n现在先探索四周，明白吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]